## Why This Is Asked

Interviews often test real-time data engineering and AI integration skills. This question probes how the candidate designs end-to-end streaming pipelines, strong privacy controls, reliable error handling, and cost-aware architecture using AWS AI services.

## Key Concepts

- Real-time streaming: Kinesis Data Streams and Lambda
- AI processing: Amazon Comprehend, SageMaker endpoint
- Data storage and protection: S3 versioning, SSE-KMS
- State and queries: DynamoDB index
- Reliability and cost: DLQ, backpressure, shard sizing

## Code Example

